drm/panel: replace init table with the NT36672 vendor sequence

The Gemini shipped in two panel variants; this unit is the Novatek
NT36672 (LK's chosen/atag,videolfb reports
aeon_nt36672_fhd_dsi_vdo_x600_xinli), but this driver was a faithful
transcription of the OTHER variant's LCM (Solomon SSD2092) -- 183
manufacturer registers that mean nothing to a Novatek controller, so
the panel never leaves its power-on state: backlight lit, glass black.

Table generated mechanically from the vendor LCM's live #if 1 branch
(183 commands + 2 delays), preserving order, packet types and delays.
The existing >=0xb0-is-generic dispatch and the power/reset sequence
are unchanged -- both already match the vendor for this variant.

